---
import '@fontsource/gothic-a1';
---

<div id="donde-estamos" class="w-full py-16 lg:py-28 font-gothic" aria-label="Ubicación y horarios">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 mb-12 lg:mb-16">
        <div class="py-10 lg:py-14 px-6 lg:px-10 border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl bg-surface/50 backdrop-blur-sm">
            <p class="text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-2xl text-center text-textMuted italic leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">Nuestra misión es proporcionar cortes de cabello de calidad en tiempos eficientes, sin comprometer la experiencia del cliente, en un ambiente profesional y amigable.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center lg:items-start lg:text-left gap-4 lg:gap-6">
                <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-5xl uppercase font-bold text-textLight">Encontranos</h3>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl text-textMuted">
                    <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/>
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/>
                        </svg>
                        Soler 398, esquina Lavalle, Ituzaingó
                    </p>
                    <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
                        </svg>
                        Martes a Sábado de 9:30 a 20 hs.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <iframe
                src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3281.9307212144267!2d-58.67314667304684!3d-34.656452499999986!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x95bcbf609e9d19df%3A0x71a8e1d95bd46dfc!2sStylos%20Barber!5e0!3m2!1ses-419!2sar!4v1726241389255!5m2!1ses-419!2sar"
                class="w-full h-[300px] sm:h-[350px] lg:h-[400px] rounded-2xl shadow-mapa border border-accentMuted"
                allowfullscreen=""
                loading="lazy"
                referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
                title="Ubicación de Stylo's Barber en el mapa"
            ></iframe>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
